  unitName: Ochaco Uraraka (Omni)
  unitId: 830588
  unitNumber: 8432
  description: A bubbly, vivacious young lady with an unexpected fierceness when
    it comes to protecting her friends, Ochaco always tries to see the good in those
    around her. Her Quirk is Zero Gravity, which allows her to make any object she
    touches float in mid air. During the U.A.'s final exam, she eventually had to
    face her own feelings towards Izuku. Her quick thinking, however, saved the day
    and got her the win she needed to pass.
  summonDesc: Everyone here is fighting for their futures! Does't that make us all
    rivals?
  fusionDesc: People want us!<br>Ha ha ha!
  evoDesc: I'm gonna become a pro!
